al post-incident assessment to evaluate the effectiveness of the continuity plan activation and overall response.\"},\"activation_condition\":\"A.Incident Severity is High\",\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"10,15,s\",\"cardinality\":null}]}"